  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "No lost events",
      "items": [
        "Events are written to the outbox in the same transaction as the domain change \u2014 if it committed, the event exists",
        "A relay/CDC publishes them to Kafka; fan-out creates one delivery per subscribed endpoint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Isolation + retries",
      "items": [
        "Delivery queues are sharded by endpoint, so one customer's failing endpoint cannot stall others",
        "Failures schedule retries by next_attempt_at; every attempt is logged"
      ]
    }
